# # Flow Diagram (Mermaid)

## Flow Diagram (Mermaid)

    ```mermaid
    flowchart TD
    A[User Enters Username and Password] --> B[System Validates Credentials]
    B --> C{Credentials Valid?}
    C -->|Yes| D[User Logged In]
    C -->|No| E[Authentication Failed]
    F[Identify Sensitive Data] --> G[Encrypt Data using AES]
    D --> F
    E --> A
    ```


